        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.795,
            0.672,
            0.907
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Recall Curiosity, Grade 7 chapter ‘Changes Around Us: Physical and Chemical’— is grinding chalk a physical change or a chemical change? You learnt that the chalk does not change into a new substance on grinding. It is a physical change in which only the size of each speck of chalk has reduced further."
            }
          ]
        },
